   "qtype": "mcq",
   "section": "Section A",
   "stem": "Let $C_{r}$ denote the coefficient of $x^{r}$ in the binomial expansion of $(1 + x)^{n}$, $n \\in N$, $0 \\le r \\le n$. If $P_{n} = C_{0} - C_{1} + \\frac{2^{2}}{3}C_{2} - \\frac{2^{3}}{4}C_{3} + \\ldots + \\frac{(-2)^{n}}{n + 1}C_{n}$, then the value of $\\sum_{n=1}^{25}\\frac{1}{P_{2n}}$ equals :",
